    <string name="policy_sdk_withdraw_text_basic_account">If you withdraw consent to the %1$s, we will only provide basic functions and stop collecting and processing your personal information. Withdrawing consent will not affect your use of the Flyme account to log in and use other Meizu products and services. If you need to cancel your account, please go to %2$s for cancellation. \n \nWithdrawing consent will clear local data and exit the application. Please consider carefully. For details, see the section on personal information subject rights in the %1$s.\n \n If you want to use our products and services again, you will need to re-enter the application and choose to agree to our %1$s or use the basic mode.</string>
    <string name="policy_sdk_withdraw_text_basic_not_account">If you withdraw consent to the %1$s, we will only provide basic functions and stop collecting and processing your personal information. Withdrawal may result in the loss of certain rights; please consider carefully. For details, refer to the Personal Information Subject Rights section of the %1$s. If you wish to use functions beyond the basic ones, you need to re-consent to our %1$s.</string>
