    <string name="policy_sdk_withdraw_text_exit">Cancel</string>
    <string name="policy_sdk_withdraw_text_not_basic_has_account">如果你撤回同意《%1$s》，我们将停止收集、处理你的个人信息，同时我们不再继续提供本应用的任何服务。撤回同意不影响你使用 Flyme 账号登录和使用本应用以外的魅族旗下其他产品和服务。如果需要注销账号，请进入%2$s进行注销\n \n撤回同意后会导致你丧失部分权益，例如...请审慎考虑，具体参见《隐私政策》个人信息主体权利部分\n \n 如果想要再次使用我们的产品和服务，你需重新进入应用，并同意我们的%1$s</string>
    <string name="policy_sdk_withdraw_text_not_basic_not_account">If you withdraw consent to the %1$s, we will stop collecting and processing your personal information, and we will no longer provide any services of this application. Withdrawal may result in the loss of certain rights; please consider carefully. For details, refer to the Personal Information Subject Rights section of the %1$s. If you wish to use our products and services again, you need to re-enter the application and agree to our %1$s.</string>
